            "about_disclaimer": "1. This tool requires a Twitch login. Your account credentials are stored locally and are never collected or transmitted.\n2. Use at your own risk. We are not responsible for any account issues, including but not limited to bans or suspensions, resulting from the use of this tool.\n3. Please verify claimed drops on the Twitch Drops Inventory page.\n4. Some games may not reliably track watch time due to issues on Twitch's side.\n5. Closing the tool will stop all mining. Keep it running to continue earning drops.\n6. If new campaigns do not appear, try running 'reload' to refresh.",
